Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:12.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.41,0:02:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, the turtle took him to a place\Ncalled Ryuuguujou as a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryuuguujou?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.10,0:02:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. At that palace,\Nthey held a welcome party for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.72,0:02:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful women, and scrumptious feasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.39,0:02:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Breams and halibut swam about,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and so he spent his time as if in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't eaten breams or\Nhalibut in quite a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Days passed before he knew it,\Nand when he was about to go back,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,he was given the Tamatebako as a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.80,0:02:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamatebako? Is that yummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not food. It's a chest with treasure inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen any treasure\Nin quite a while either...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.85,0:02:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are so tasteless.\NThis is an old fantasy tale!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The turtle's Tamatebako...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you listening to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I should quit the horses now. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay up 6300 woolongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.19,0:03:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What, where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This was for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,For... me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,C.O.D. Even.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,To top it off, no return address.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to accept it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What about the 6300 woolongs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Busy woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be a collection agency\Nfrom the life extension firm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oooh... I just have too\Nmany things it could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So for now, I'll just run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's fishy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For a woman who always claims\Nother people's property
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,as her own to run away\Nwithout even touching it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.49,0:04:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems she’s picked up\Nlots of grudges from all over. {original: "She seems to have picked up a lot of grudges from all over, though."}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I should do an explosives test and\Na biochemical test just in case...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I should return this to\Nthe courier service
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.93,0:04:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and have them refund\Nthe money I paid for her sake...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.59,0:04:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.58,0:04:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it make any ticking noises?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I got data!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.79,0:05:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Data from the courier service!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The sender is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.47,0:05:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A nonprofit nunnery in Europa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.18,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pluto Prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Asteroid Actors' Studio?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth Uranus Observatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.52,0:05:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Venus News Network?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Forwarded, forwarded,\Nand forwarded some more...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.11,0:05:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing's been passed around\Nthe entire solar system.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to the explosion of the Lunar Gate,\Nall data from before 2022 has been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,An antique.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.21,0:05:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be something called a videotape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,An artifact of the good old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the one that ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She has no right to complain\Neven if we sell it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it will sell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he's a maniac when it\Ncomes to 20th century images...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'd buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't think this is worth anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.21,0:06:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The real worth of treasures like this\Ncan't be determined from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be surprised at how\Nmuch you can sell it for!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get enough to cover\Nthe C.O.D. Charges at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.22,0:06:18.06,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything about this city is different{\i0}\N{\i1}from Minnesota, where we were before.{\i0} {1 frame extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, brother, are you sure{\i0}\N{\i1}we can get along well here?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mm... To tell the truth,{\i0}\N{\i1}I wasn't so sure that we could.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.65,0:06:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But, I'm sure we'll be all right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.18,0:06:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because I'm here with my twin sister.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks, brother.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh man, I have to work in the morning!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good night, brother.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good night!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,God, that's good! Drama series\Nfrom the 20th century are so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other hand...\NDrama series as of late are so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something you want to watch—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.95,0:06:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:07:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, you can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The cigarette, man, the cigarette!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.59,0:07:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that smoke can totally\Nscrew up electrical appliances?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, this is why I hate\Npeople who don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, idiot, idiot, idiot! Sheesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you guys want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you have against me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No grudges, but no gratitude, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have something we\Nwant you to buy from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Is that a Beta cassette?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get a hold of this?\NThis is a true find, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's close to a miracle that\Nthis thing exists in one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Beta?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know what this is?\NOh, all right, do you want me to explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Back in the 20th Century, they didn't\Nuse disks like we do to record movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They used things called video tapes,\Nwhich are in cassettes like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.41,0:07:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not digital! It's analog!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.25,0:07:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And to top it off,\Nit's magnetic... Yeah, magnetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They were recording with electromagnetic\Nsignals! Ain't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But a disagreement between\Nthe companies who created
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,this technology resulted in\Ntwo standards, Beta and VHS.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Beta had a small cassette for their day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and the playback decks were compact\Nand didn't take much space.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't get much noise when using special features like freeze frame and slow-mo. {original: "You didn't get that much noise when using the special replay features like still frame and slow motion."}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And, because Beta had high quality images,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.69,0:08:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,users who were into good graphics\Nsupported it really heavily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But, there begins the unfortunate\Nhistory of the Beta tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? This is just the introduction!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.66,0:08:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you what we wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.93,0:08:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So how is it? Are ya gonna buy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that depends on what's on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hard to adjust the tracking\Nfor these early Beta tapes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This way?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Or this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's eating the tape!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not getting any better...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.07,0:09:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It is... It is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogs are better than horses after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Most things get better if I kick 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't know when to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dammit, repay me for breaking my deck!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You again...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You broke someone else's{\i0}\N{\i1}valuable machinery{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and you're not going to\Ntake responsibility for it?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.18,0:10:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And how are you going to take\Nresponsibility for our valuable tape?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Early Beta decks often eat tapes!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In any case, I'll have you{\i0}\N{\i1}pay for the repair costs!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll call it even with\Nthe cost of the tape!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?! Beta—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Beta deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.45,0:10:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Underground City\NElectrical Museum in old Asia?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to figure out what's\Non that tape at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.85,0:10:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really something worth all the trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming... It's... It's... It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.60,0:10:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, I wonder if those guys were\Nsucking up all my luck all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah... Hello.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? {added this}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, helllllloooooo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah... it's... Faye... Yoohoo...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? What is this, where are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Earth...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Earth!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, you guys left me\Nbehind to go that far away...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike... and Jet...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there really one left in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.25,0:12:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing ventured, nothing gained.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,28th underground floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The cable broke, so it's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.19,0:14:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we going through all of this? {9 frames but made it 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It just means that\Ntreasure-hunting isn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.74,0:14:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What was the treasure we were after?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tamatebako, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:14:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I kinda see why the man\Nturned into an old geezer
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,after opening the Tamatebako now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we head back now,\Nwe're not gonna be any younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is some Ryuuguujou...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that broad go\Nin the first place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming... It's, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, nothing I could've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Races are all luck anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.75,0:15:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it here? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.60,0:15:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this it? {9 frames, nearly 8}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's gotta be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.03,0:16:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one are we taking back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, bigger is always better, they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The size...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.93,0:16:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.82,0:16:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Force it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's VHS, so
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,ya can't see the tape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, it's me. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ein, who are you talking to?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, it's Faye!{\i0} {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad there's an organism\Nthere that I can talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.49,0:17:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there anyone who went\Nthere to visit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Visitors?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Like scary middle-aged guys.\NYou know, guys that scream stuff like
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"Gimme back my money!"\NOr "You're under arrest!"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah there was one.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? And?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something about repay him, even with{\i0}\N{\i1}tape munch, munch and grind, bye-bye!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.83,0:17:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Spike and Jet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.47,0:18:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Disappointed and zoned out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're so lonely without me,\NI guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Another package for that broad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.53,0:18:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't accept it! Take it and go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.05,0:18:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, why do I have to pay for {\i1}her{\i0} C.O.D?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And not once, but twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A Beta!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We can see the tape with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.34,0:18:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.99,0:18:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.85,0:19:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,pay back the C.O.D. Charges.\NWith tax, a total of 31,500 woolongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.35,0:19:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooooh... what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.28,0:20:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone decided to{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.11,0:20:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}send a message to themselves{\i0}\N{\i1}ten years in the future.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.71,0:20:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, come on, don't laugh!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Um...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This makes me blush after all!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eh? Something I want to say?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.15,0:20:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good morning...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.93,0:20:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh! Never mind!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.77,0:20:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good morning, me.{\i0} {13 frame link}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did you sleep well?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.61,0:20:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And did you wake up well?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:21:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does the light and the wind,\Nthe air and the smell, all feel brand new?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is each and every cell{\i0}\N{\i1}in your body awake now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today, you are who you are today.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.49,0:21:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are a newer version of me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Myself ten years from now...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's so far away for me that{\i0}\N{\i1}I can't even begin to imagine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.83,0:21:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I alone?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.66,0:21:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or is there a wonderful person next to me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, knowing me, I'm sure I am{\i0}\N{\i1}troubling a lot of different people.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.41,0:21:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that's all right. There's no problem.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will always be cheering you on.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now for a big cheer...{\i0}\N{\i1}from the bottom of my heart.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.76,0:21:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go! Go!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Me, me, me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do your best, do your best! Me, me, me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.68,0:22:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't lose, don't lose! Me, me, me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.89,0:22:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.01,0:22:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't remember...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this... me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am no longer here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I'm here today, and I'll always{\i0}\N{\i1}be cheering for you right here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.47,0:22:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cheering for you, my only self.{\i0}
