Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.50,0:23:54.23,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}ichido kiri de owaru nara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:54.23,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.50,0:23:54.23,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.94,0:24:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm starting to get tired of\Nus doing all the previews like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.52,0:24:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Once in a while, can't we\Nhave someone else...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.14,0:24:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Oh! You're perfect. All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.85,0:24:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you try doing it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! So, {\i1}that's{\i0} how it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.82,0:24:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is going to be\Nan interesting episode!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.77,0:24:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Next Episode: Wild Horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.65,0:24:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it spoke!
